WEBVTT

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:17.590
That day— ever since what happened 
that day, I can't get Rinne off my mind.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.290
I keep thinking about him day and night.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.880
Could I be in love?

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:34.380
No, maybe it's a misattribution of arousal.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:37.510
It could just be TBK.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.550
<i>TBK, or Misattribution of Arousal,</i>

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:44.200
<i>is that thing where two people 
crossing a suspension bridge together</i>

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.520
<i>confuse their arousal excitement for 
love, and end up really falling in love.</i>

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.580
I might just be confusing the excitement 
of being attacked by that Damashigami

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.560
as the excitement of being in love.

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:01.080
I have to make sure.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:04.960
No requests.

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:08.280
Another peaceful day, I guess.

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.720
No, it's not peaceful.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.200
<i>I still haven't set things 
straight with Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:18.290
<i>I have to let her know there's 
nothing between me and Ageha.</i>

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.200
What are you doing?

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.270
Just testing for TBK.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.830
TBK?

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:29.520
What are you—

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:33.360
Mamiya Sakura.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.740
See you tomorrow, Rokumon-chan.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.420
Are you going home already, Sakura-sama?

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.210
Yeah, I have homework.

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:43.620
Second term's getting tough already, huh?

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:47.040
Okay, see you tomorrow, Sakura-sama.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:21.010
Just a Thank You

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.750
Mamiya Sakura, we need to talk.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:25.760
Rokudou-kun.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.810
It's about what happened the other day.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:31.890
Oh, about how you were embracing 
that Shinigami girl, Ageha?

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.310
I think you're making some kind of mistake.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.620
I never asked for it. Ageha just—

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.020
Morning, Sakura-chan.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.010
Morning.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:40.660
Did you see that thing on TV yesterday?

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.000
<i>When Rinne wears his Haori of the Underworld,</i>

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.580
<i>not only is he invisible to most people, 
but they can pass right through him.</i>

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.630
I know, right?

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:50.570
That was great.

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:53.590
I totally didn't do my homework.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.590
Got it, Mamiya Sakura?

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:54.670
You don't get it, do you?

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:00.490
I made lunch for a guy for 
the first time in my life.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.950
I hope Rinne likes it.

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:09.390
<i>Fabulous. Are you a culinary genius?</i>

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.810
<i>You put your life on the line to save me.</i>

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.190
<i>It's just a thank you.</i>

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:17.350
<i>Go out with me, Ageha-san.</i>

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:19.290
<i>You can call me Ageha.</i>

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.320
I can just picture a beautiful future.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:27.320
Huh?

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:32.060
My, she's trying to express 
her feelings for someone, too.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.320
I wish her well.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:40.590
I have this legendary stacked lunch box 
that's said to grant any kind of wish.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.970
As long as I have this, 
I could win in love, too.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.320
Evil spirit!

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.550
Take this, Holy Ash!

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.250
What was that for!

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.610
A Shinigami Scythe?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.940
Are you one of Rokudou's kind?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.790
You can see me?

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:03.530
What are you?

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.890
I'm Rokudou's classmate.

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:07.460
A friend?

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.270
We aren't friends!

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:11.910
I'm a romantic rival.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:13.800
A romantic rival?!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.820
I have a rival already?

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:21.300
Are you in love with Rinne, too?

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.420
But you're a guy!

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.920
Hang on!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.970
You're getting mixed up.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:29.290
I'm in love with Mamiya Sakura-san.

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:32.730
Rokudou, that bastard! All because he's poor...

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:35.850
<i>Poor Rokudou-kun is poor.</i>

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:40.860
I'm constantly freaking out that 
her sympathy might turn to love.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.360
<i>Mamiya Sakura?</i>

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:47.320
<i>That's the girl that keeps 
hanging out around Rinne.</i>

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:51.720
Damn it! If only Rokudou weren't poor.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.050
Leave it to me.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:59.390
I'll save him from his poverty with my 
lavish handmade lunches. Every day.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:00.490
Every day?

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:01.850
Every day.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:03.370
Excellent!

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:05.090
You have my support.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:08.840
There!

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:11.720
Rinne.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:16.650
Crunch!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:17.890
Why do you run from me?

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.750
H-H-Here, lunch.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:22.900
Lunch?

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:25.400
Yeah, to thank you about the other day.

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.040
I see.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.540
<i>This'll save me some lunch money.</i>

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:33.560
<i>But I still haven't cleared up 
Mamiya Sakura's misunderstanding.</i>

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.540
<i>If I took this now...</i>

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.330
It's really just a thank you.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.420
All right.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:40.040
It's really just a thank you.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:44.670
<i>It's really just a thank you, so it's 
not a problem that I take it.</i>

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:49.340
<i>But it would be dangerous to eat 
this in front of Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.050
<i>It'll make things look even worse.</i>

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:55.650
<i>I'll split it up and enjoy some for dinner.</i>

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.690
Fall in.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.070
Is Rokudou absent?

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.060
He's not here.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.400
Yeah?

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.920
Okay, boys, get in pairs to do stretches.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.070
Okay.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:09.510
Mamiya Sakura.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:12.440
Loosen up good.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.440
Let's continue where we left off.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:13.820
Rokudou-kun.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:16.710
Girls, go burn off some energy. 
Three laps around the field!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.380
Okay.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.440
Mamiya Sakura.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.100
Sakura-chan, let's go to 
the bathroom together.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:29.570
Okay.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.830
I bought a new planner yesterday.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.440
Really? What's it like?

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:36.310
<i>Seriously, aren't you old enough to 
go to the bathroom by yourselves?</i>

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:36.310
It's really cute.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.070
<i>You, too, Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.490
<i>Why don't you refuse?</i>

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:43.690
<i>Or do you not want to hear me out?</i>

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:46.300
Rokudou.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.470
Jumonji.

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:50.420
I met Ageha the Shinigami.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.260
She's pretty obsessed, and she's cute.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.900
You should go out with her; 
you're both Shinigami.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:59.540
There's nothing like that between us.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.430
Is she not your type?

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:03.870
It's not about whether 
I like her or hate her.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.580
So you don't hate her.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.100
Huh? Tell me, what was that about?

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.130
Mamiya-san heard you, huh?

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.590
<i>Why is that the only thing you hear?</i>

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:17.050
<i>I need to find a chance to talk to her alone.</i>

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.700
Lunchtime, finally!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:21.730
Let's go buy bread.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.700
Sorry, Sakura-chan.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:26.530
The student council's holding 
a meeting during lunch today.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:28.770
I have a club meeting, too.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:31.770
Okay, I'll eat alone today.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:32.650
<i>Chance!</i>

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:38.340
Thank goodness, I made it in time for lunch.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.580
Rokumon, you...

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.660
That's your lunch, right?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.540
You left it in your room.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.540
Look, it's Ageha's hand-made lunch.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.900
It's a stacked lunch box.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:51.210
That broke Rokudou has a stacked lunch box?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:55.090
Rokudou-kun, you have a girlfriend 
to make lunch for you?

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.510
That's kind of a shock.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.790
This is an outrageous misunderstanding!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:02.390
This is... this is for s-saving her life.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.780
There's no way this is just a thank you.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:08.580
Who said you could open it?

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.610
It's a heart.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.030
A wakame heart, huh? Weird.

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:14.030
Is this black stuff nori?

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.030
No, it's overcooked fried eggs.

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:19.660
This whole layer's octopus-san wieners.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.930
Full of love.

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:23.040
I'm not so sure.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.600
This is really just a thank you.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.940
Sure, it's super-lavish, but...

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.400
Super-lavish, huh?

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:30.790
Really, Rokudou?

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.300
<i>No, this is bad.</i>

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:36.220
She gave you a boxed lunch.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.820
So you and Ageha really are...

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:42.060
<i>This just makes things look even worse!</i>

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.480
<i>We... we really need to talk alone.</i>

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.690
<i>Huh? Something's coming out of the lunch box.</i>

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:54.820
I wonder if he's having lunch about now.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:00.470
Hi.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.340
Oh, Grandma.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.880
Lunch box?

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:05.880
Yeah, I used it.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.110
The one in the shed.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:08.040
I unsealed it.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:13.670
<i>The legendary stacked lunch box, passed 
down in my family for generations.</i>

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.990
<i>It's said that it'll grant any kind of wish,</i>

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:19.840
<i>but the wishes are granted by 
an evil spirit sealed within it.</i>

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.960
<i>In exchange for having their wishes granted,</i>

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:25.350
<i>those who receive the box have their 
souls consumed by the evil spirit.</i>

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.190
No one ever told me!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.760
Huh? We're...

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:32.860
How?

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.850
I thought we were in our classroom just now.

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:39.030
Why are we in the hallway?

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:42.950
I don't know what's going, 
but we're finally alone together.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:46.040
Rokudou-kun, behind you.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.960
Rinne, are you all right?

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:56.650
What's going on?

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:57.920
We can't get into the classroom.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.220
<i>Ageha the Shinigami.</i>

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.890
Damn it, there's a barrier.

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:05.680
Open up!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.140
Hey.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.620
Do you really need to keep 
throwing your Holy Ash?

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.070
What are you making a fuss about?

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.880
This is bad.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.240
We have to tell Rinne.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:19.890
What are you talking about?

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:20.820
What's going on?

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:23.620
Jumonji-kun's talking to himself.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.200
He's kind of messed up sometimes.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:29.200
<i>Ageha is a Shinigami. 
Most people can't see her.</i>

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:30.580
What?

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.710
An evil spirit trapped in the lunch box?

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.960
In Rinne-sama's lunch?!

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:40.220
Then was it the evil 
spirit that kicked everyone

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.590
but Rokudou and Mamiya-san 
out of the classroom?

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:46.320
Mamiya Sakura, I wanted to talk to you alone.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.330
Rokudou-kun.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.520
You seem to be under a misunderstanding.

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:53.770
What, damn it?

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:56.770
State your next wish.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.320
It talked.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.030
An octopus-san wiener.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.990
Rokudou-kun, is that the sausage fairy?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.510
I am the Konjikiou.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:12.540
This body is a false form that connects 
my soul to the corporeal realm.

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.170
Corporeal realm?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.710
So, like, meatspace.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.460
We're actually talking to ground meat.

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:21.710
You there, boy, I shall 
grant you three wishes.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.680
State your second wish.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:26.190
What?!

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:30.020
It's an evil spirit that consumes 
souls in exchange for three wishes?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.610
Then...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:37.830
That bastard, Rokudou must have wished to 
be alone in the classroom with Mamiya-san!

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:39.620
No way!

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.050
Come out, Rokudou!

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:43.570
What a vile wish you made!

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:46.950
You're awful! I gave you my lunch!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.910
State your second wish.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:53.220
Oh, no wishing for more wishes.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.210
That's just cheap.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.330
I don't have time for that.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:59.340
I need to talk to Mamiya Sakura.

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:02.420
What is it that you want to 
talk to me about, Rokudou-kun?

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:04.390
Well, like,

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:07.380
you seem to have the wrong idea about 
my friendship with Ageha the Shinigami.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.470
There's seriously nothing between us.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.520
Yeah, and?

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:12.690
And?

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:17.020
<i>What? What else am I supposed to say?</i>

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:21.650
<i>I thought she wasn't talking to me 
because she was jealous and angry.</i>

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:23.650
<i>No, wait.</i>

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:28.210
I can't accept an engagement ring.

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:31.660
Rokudou-kun and I are just classmates.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:34.200
<i>Right.</i>

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:38.080
<i>Mamiya Sakura just thinks 
of me as a classmate.</i>

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.570
<i>No, wait.</i>

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:41.040
<i>Then why is she angry?</i>

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:44.670
<i>Or am I just imagining she's angry?</i>

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.330
<i>I can't tell.</i>

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:49.050
<i>I can't tell what Mamiya Sakura is thinking.</i>

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.390
<i>I want to know how she feels.</i>

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.170
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.720
Why so silent?

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:01.270
Speak to the Konjikiou 
about what troubles you.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.360
Damn it. Shut up for a second!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:04.360
Tako!

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:06.360
Tako!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:12.080
It counted your wish for it to be quiet.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.090
What a waste.

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.720
I don't even care.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:21.210
This whacko couldn't 
possibly fix my problems.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.570
Now, one more wish.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.010
Wish for anything you'd like.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.130
To be rich.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:32.170
To do as you will with the woman you desire.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:33.810
You can have anything.

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:36.240
Damn that Rokudou!

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:39.620
He's totally going to ask Mamiya-san out!

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:40.600
What?!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.330
Why would he go out with <i>her</i>?

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:46.090
He's definitely mistaking her pity for love.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:47.020
No!

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:47.990
That's awful!

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:50.360
We need to set things straight.

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:56.160
Rinne, you better not let your soul 
be eaten for such a stupid wish!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.540
Rinne-sama!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.590
Don't say your wish!

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:01.330
It's an evil spirit!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.340
<i>Do as I will with the woman I desire?</i>

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.030
<i>Does that mean to control her mind?</i>

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:14.550
<i>That's like something 
an evil spirit could do.</i>

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:17.350
Dude, you're an evil spirit.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.560
H-How dare you?!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:23.360
I-I'm not an evil spirit!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.110
No, sir!

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:25.400
Are you?

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.710
You are, huh?

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:29.980
What's that?

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.110
Tada!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:35.220
Now you know my secret.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:38.040
I shall have your soul!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.420
I'm not a wiener!

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:48.120
We're finally in!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.300
Rokumon-chan.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.640
I broke the barrier with this.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:16:01.140
Barrier Solution Spray

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:56.970
<i>Barrier Solution Spray. A Shinigami 
tool to break through any barrier.</i>

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.440
<i>Costs 20,000 yen.</i>

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:01.140
<i>Taxes not included.</i>

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:03.650
That's nothing.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.510
Mamiya-san, are you okay?

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:08.700
Rokudou didn't do anything 
weird to you in here, did he?

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.120
No, nothing.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:13.200
Rokudou-kun was a bit weird, but...

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.100
Mamiya Sakura.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:19.910
I warn you as a Shinigami: stay 
away from Rinne from now on.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:20.370
Huh?

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:22.620
Why?

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:24.580
"Why?"

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:25.990
<i>What?</i>

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:28.090
<i>How is she not freaking out?</i>

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:31.830
Well, because it could be dangerous.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:33.590
Nah, it's not that bad.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:38.100
<i>Are these two already dating?</i>

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:45.030
<i>Then I'm like an oblivious third 
wheel, making him lunch and stuff.</i>

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:50.680
<i>I have KYP!</i>

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:53.220
She's leaving?

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.150
That's one shy girl.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.360
You sure?

00:16:58.390 --> 00:17:00.870
Stay away from Rinne from now on.

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.660
<i>I kind of don't want to.</i>

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:11.960
<i>I'm such a joke.</i>

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.540
<i>I'm so embarrassed.</i>

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.170
<i>I want to forget all of it.</i>

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:18.320
<i>About Rokudou Rinne.</i>

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.130
<i>About the fact that I liked him.</i>

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:21.610
<i>Everything.</i>

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.180
Hi.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:27.900
Oh, Grandma.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:29.230
What?

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.040
<i>That was a disaster.</i>

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:37.670
<i>But at least Rokudou didn't 
ask to go out with Mamiya-san.</i>

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:45.000
<i>No, if he'd asked for something and had his 
soul consumed, I would have lost a rival.</i>

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.920
<i>What a shame!</i>

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.730
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:51.380
What?

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:55.370
You can become the world's richest man.

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:56.590
Laughable.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:57.880
I'll exterminate you!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:00.800
You can do as you will 
with the woman you desire.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.180
As... I will?

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:19.950
You can do as you will.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.940
I can do as I will with Mamiya-san?

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:13.710
I can't have my soul taken by an 
evil spirit; I <i>fight</i> evil spirits!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:17.390
But wait, do as I will with Mamiya-san?

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.950
What the hell do I do?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.340
You can do as you will.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.200
Do as I will?!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:29.130
How can you let an evil 
spirit delude you like that?

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.360
It seems I couldn't finish it off.

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.170
It divided and ran off.

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:33.840
What?

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:36.400
They're not that harmful, 
but there's a lot of them.

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.220
We need to purify them before they grow.

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:40.080
All right.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.800
I don't like this, but we 
should get Rokudou's backup.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:44.780
That's not...

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.500
What's wrong? We'll need 
more than two people.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.390
No, I'll go ask Rokudou Rinne myself.

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:52.450
You go ahead and start purifying them.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:53.150
I see.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.070
All right.

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:58.080
But I can't ask him.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:02.160
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.490
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:09.210
Lucifer

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.670
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:17.370
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:19.090
My wishes?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.840
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:24.520
Anything I wish for?

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:27.550
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.230
Yeah? Then...

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.730
Your wish is my command.

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:41.240
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:44.240
I'm not a wiener!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.860
Don't go asking evil spirits 
to grant your wishes.

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.320
What's wrong?

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.130
Weren't you going to let me forget?

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:59.350
About him, and about how I liked him.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:00.360
Everything.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.550
Of course you can't.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:08.880
If only I'd known sooner 
that he had a girlfriend.

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:13.350
So you're a KYP, too.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.650
An oblivious third wheel.

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:19.650
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.440
I want to forget everything, too.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.810
Actually, it's fine.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:26.980
I'll remember this forever.

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:31.270
I mean,

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:36.800
falling in love isn't 
something to be ashamed of.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:38.790
Is it?

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:47.300
<i>I failed to find out how 
Mamiya Sakura feels again.</i>

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:51.270
<i>I don't know what kind of face 
to have next time I see her.</i>

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.650
<i>Stay away from Rokudou Rinne from now on.</i>

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:05.610
<i>It's not like I'm hanging 
around him because I want to.</i>

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.220
<i>But when you say it like that...</i>

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:31.010
I shall grant you your wishes.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.520
I shall grant y—

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:35.230
Shush.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:37.290
They aren't all gone yet?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.480
Which means there might still be more.

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:43.100
It'll be hard to find and purify all of them.

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:43.990
What will you do?

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:47.110
Mamiya Sakura, I need you 
to do something for me.

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:51.240
Could you lend me 500 yen?

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:54.750
Sure.

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:56.500
Rinne.

00:21:58.370 --> 00:21:59.150
Rinne.

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:01.320
Help me hunt down these evil spirits.

00:22:03.110 --> 00:22:04.420
I'll pay you for it.

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:05.250
Pay?!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:06.800
It's really just a side job.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.130
It's really just a side job.

00:22:10.940 --> 00:22:14.190
No, seriously, it's really 
just a side job, it's not—

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:15.190
Sakura-chan.

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.640
Let's walk home together.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:17.530
Okay.

00:22:18.470 --> 00:22:20.200
Hey, want to go somewhere?

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:22.100
I want kebabs!

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:22.810
Sounds good.

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:24.810
Got it, Mamiya Sakura?

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:26.110
You don't get it, do you?!

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:30.990
Let's go on our first job together!

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
Memories of the Haunted Cedar

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:04.530
Hey, Rika-chan, Sakura-chan. 
Is there a horror story that you like?

00:24:04.530 --> 00:24:06.540
I guess I like "Mary-san."

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:08.050
You, Sakura-chan?

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:10.030
This one about a girl who can see ghosts who

00:24:10.030 --> 00:24:12.970
makes friends with a Shinigami 
who hunts evil spirits,

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:17.560
and she gets taken to the afterlife and 
attacked by evil spirits and stuff.

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:18.750
What the heck?!

00:24:18.750 --> 00:24:19.930
That's freaky!

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:23.960
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
 "Memories of the Haunted Cedar"

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:25.980
Is it a horror story?
